WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.170 --> 00:00:04.019
For this quiz, I want you to imagine
that you're a graphic designer.

00:00:04.019 --> 00:00:08.263
A friend asks you to to make a 50 meter,
or a 165 foot banner,

00:00:08.263 --> 00:00:09.818
made for a skyscraper.

00:00:09.818 --> 00:00:12.527
The banner will have some
kind of company logo here and

00:00:12.527 --> 00:00:14.360
then some text next to it.

00:00:14.360 --> 00:00:18.600
So should you give your friend
a vector or a raster image?

00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:19.290
And why?

00:00:19.290 --> 00:00:22.029
Should it be a vector because
the file size is smaller?

00:00:22.029 --> 00:00:26.074
Should it be a vector because it will
scale without quality degradation?

00:00:26.074 --> 00:00:29.161
Should it be a raster image because
the file size will be smaller?

00:00:29.161 --> 00:00:32.189
Or should it be a raster image
because it will scale without quality

00:00:32.189 --> 00:00:33.310
degradation?

00:00:33.310 --> 00:00:34.140
Pick one of these four.

